          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Underestimating the room it needs</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">This is a large, heavy treadmill with a wide console. Measure the doorway, the stairwell turn, and the wall space beside the machine before ordering, not after delivery is booked.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming the incline range matches an incline trainer</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">The 2450 climbs to 15%, not the 40% of the X22i. Trail workouts built for the incline trainers will flatten out on this frame.</p>
