          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying on a sale price without checking the model year</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Discounted listings are sometimes the previous generation with a near-identical name. Check the console size and model year against the current spec sheet before you take a deal at face value.</p>
